    // and (b) contradicted the studio's policy of "use credits up
    // while confirming/checking out". We now:
    //   1. Read all eligible wallets ordered by expiry (FIFO).
    //   2. Fail fast if the customer doesn't have `quantity` credits.
    //   3. Stamp the oldest-contributing wallet on the attendance so
    //      cancellation can find a refund target (refund itself walks
    //      the ledger for the full multi-wallet case).
